  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Sleeping Arrangements <br>Three Story Home with Separate Carriage House<br>2nd Floor | Guest 1, King Bed; Guest 2, 2 Twin over Twin Bunks; Living Area, Sleeper Sofa<br>3rd Floor | Master 1, King Bed; Master 2, King Bed<br>Carriage House | Queen Bed & Queen Sleeper Sofa<br><br>Parking: This property offers two parking spots, providing easy and reliable access for guests throughout their stay.<br><br>Experience Your Vacation Haven<br><br>Live like royalty on your next Destin vacation! Rolling Dunes is a treasure among the Florida rentals, featuring three floors of luxury, a separate carriage house, private pool, and 6-seat golf cart. Don’t forgo fun on your next Gulf getaway. Come stay on Winston Lane and let the good times roll!<br><br>This high end home offers 4 bedrooms in the main house and a bedroom in the carriage house, so everyone will have the space they need to rest and relax. The home features two masters on the third floor, both with vaulted ceilings, plush bedding, and en suite bathrooms with walk-in showers and separate soaker tubs. The rest of the bedrooms also feature their own baths for maximum privacy, flat screen TVs, and chic décor.<br><br>Divvy up the rooms and head down to your private pool in the backyard, equipped with loungers, a grill, and space to play some beach games. Grill up some food or use the chef’s kitchen on the first floor, featuring stainless steel appliances and an extra beverage fridge for cold drinks and beach snacks. Enjoy your meal on the patio or in the spacious dining room, perfect for hosting large groups and social gatherings. If you’re bringing the kids, let them hang upstairs in the home’s second living room while the adults chill downstairs on the main floor.<br><br>When it’s time to have some fun, pack up the group, jump in your golf cart, and head to the sugar white sands everyone’s been talking about. Just a few minutes away, your tropical paradise awaits! From your Gulf home away from home, you’re a quick drive to the beach, the bay, award-winning golf courses, and so much more.<br><br>Don’t settle for less on this trip. Book this dream house and make some lasting memories.<br><br>Guest Walk-Through<br>Three Story Home with Separate Carriage House<br>Main House<br>1st Floor—Kitchen, Dining Room, Living Room, Half Bath, Patio, Pool<br>2nd Floor—2 Bedrooms, 2 Full Baths, Den, Laundry, Balcony<br>3rd Floor—2 Bedrooms, 2 Full Baths, Balcony<br>Carriage House<br>1st Floor—Garage <br>2nd Floor—Full Kitchen, Living Area, Queen Bed, Full Bath<br><br>Unit Amenities- Private Pool, 6-Seat Golf Cart, Laundry, Balconies, Driveway, Garage<br><br>About the Community of Inlet Beach on 30A<br>Away from the resorts, you’ll find the old-world charm of Inlet Beach on 30A. This tranquil area is the place to relax on the shoreline, enjoy the slow-paced vibe of the Gulf, and discover the never-ending fun Destin has to offer. The rentals in the Inlet Beach community are sure to impress featuring everything you need to make yourself at home. Explore the cobblestone roads, take the walking path to the beach, and eat all the stellar food you can find in this little slice of heaven. From high-end gastronomy to award-winning golf courses, you can have it all when you stay in this coastal sanctuary. Amenities such as golf, tennis, biking, boating, water sports & more are available locally at additional costs.<br> <br>Local Favorites<br>MVH guests receive savings with our Local Favorites. Enjoy discounts to restaurants, beach activities, and shopping so you can save while you stay.<br><br>MVH Beach Closet<br>This property offers a Beach Closet stocked with complimentary beach chairs and an umbrella for use during your stay.<br><br>MVH Rental Restrictions<br>Please reference the Rental Restrictions and Terms of Use. <br><br>Heating for pools is available at an additional cost. Please contact our office for pricing details.",
